  Prefab: {fileID: 6625514644646704096, guid: 1f6a6789373206e498f996cb54aeedb1, type: 3}
  Interactable: {fileID: 5048261325816738630, guid: 1f6a6789373206e498f996cb54aeedb1, type: 3}
  TextFields:
  - 
  - "Astrid\u2014\n\nSo glad you left your aunt\u2019s place! It was time. I hope
    she at least said thank you.\n\nAbout your story idea...I wish I had better news
    because your instincts are right. This meteor storm could create mass panic.
    But my editor says we need details to run it - not just Elijah's theories. The
    next paper goes to print on October 1st. When you get more info, write us back.
    Or, you know, write back anyway.\n\nYour friend,\nJocelyn\n"
  - P.S. I love the work you are doing - charting the stars, telling stories about
    the sky instead of hiding from it. This could be a regular column. Would you
    be willing to move here for a job?
